  "description": "An engine-neutral console foundation with manager-centered logging, retained entries, command history, typed synchronous and asynchronous command workflows, streamed output, progress reporting, stateless autocomplete, permissions, availability checks, and an opt-in configurable help command. Workes.ContentSystem provides internal storage while the public API remains ConsoleSystem-owned.",
