  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 0.8.0 adds immediate streamed command output, optional per-execution progress state, and transient manager progress notifications with terminal outcomes. It also includes asynchronous command execution, cooperative cancellation, optional host-thread callback dispatch, and synchronized histories. The package continues the ContentSystem-backed rebuild introduced in 0.2.0; ContentSystem remains outside the public API. This pre-1.0 release is not a drop-in upgrade from earlier package versions.",
